classDiagram
direction LR

class GoAuthority {
  +increment_channel
  +update_channel
  +channel_close
  +channel_member_update
}

class DialogListFrameState {
  +HashMap rows_by_channel
  +Vec ordered_channel_ids
  +patch_from_channel_update()
  +interaction_view()
}

class LegacyOperations {
  +UpsertRow
  +MoveRow
  +operations
}

class InteractionFrameV1 {
  +schemaVersion = 1
  +transactionId
  +mutations
}

class ReplaceViewPatch {
  +kind = replaceView
  +DialogListVm view
}

class AngularCodec {
  +isReplaceViewPatch()
  +exactKeys()
}

class SurfaceRuntime {
  +stageMutation()
  +viewForMutation()
  +atomicSwap()
}

class DialogListComponent {
  +render sections
  +render rows
}

GoAuthority --> DialogListFrameState : 权威事件
DialogListFrameState --> LegacyOperations : 内部计算
DialogListFrameState ..> LegacyOperations : 正式 wire 前丢弃
DialogListFrameState --> ReplaceViewPatch : 重建全部列表
ReplaceViewPatch --> InteractionFrameV1
InteractionFrameV1 --> AngularCodec
AngularCodec --> SurfaceRuntime
SurfaceRuntime --> DialogListComponent

note for DialogListFrameState "单行命中不是全表读库\n但 interaction_view 为 O(n)"
note for ReplaceViewPatch "每次传输全部 pinned/normal/closed"
note for SurfaceRuntime "当前 patch 直接替换完整 VM"
